===Interjection===
{{en-interj}}

# {{n-g|A call to gain someone's attention}}; [[hey]]!
#* {{quote-book|1=en|year=1891|author=w:Thomas Hardy|title=w:Tess of the d'Urbervilles|publisher=James R. Osgood, McIlvaine and Co.|location=London|volume=1|page=55|passage=A hollow groan, unlike anything she had ever heard in her life, came from the front, followed by a shout of "'''Hoi''', there!"}}

